      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "Six responsibilities could bury the simple case",
        "description": "A handler with triggers, conditions, effects, limits, and history fields could become a form nobody finishes filling in, making the common one-trigger, one-reaction case harder than it is today.",
        "likelihood": "medium",
        "impact": "medium",
        "mitigation": "Require only a trigger and a reaction. Every other responsibility is optional with a safe default, and the node shows only what was authored.",
        "definitionKey": "idea-risk",
