        "action": "Draw the handler node showing trigger, condition, reaction, declared effects, and last run on one card, then show it to an author who has not seen the source and ask what it does and what it may change.",
        "expectedEvidence": "The reviewer can state what the handler does and what it may change without opening the source.",
        "status": "proposed",
        "definitionKey": "idea-next-step",
